1. Run the following mutation:
```
mutation {
  productTypeCreate(input: {name: "New tax class", taxCode: "P0000000"}) {
    errors {
      field
      message
    }
    productType {
      id
      slug
      taxClass {
        id
      }
    }
  }
}
